# Demo mode does not require any environment variables.
# Run `npm install` then `npm run dev` and open http://localhost:3000.
#
# The values below are only needed when you switch to a real Postgres backend
# (see README.md → "Switching to a real database").

# DATABASE_URL=postgres://user:password@localhost:5432/contractor_os
# DEV_COMPANY_ID=
# DEV_USER_ID=
